    "label": "名称暂不可用",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "To continue with the system in Example 3.6, determine the response to an input that begins at t=0 as u(t)=sin(10 t)1(t). The output using partial fraction expansion is given by Y(s)=1/(s+1) * 10/(s^2+100) = α1/(s+1) + α0/(s+j10) + α0*/(s-j10). The inverse Laplace transform of the output is y(t)=10/101 e^{-t} + 1/√101 sin(10 t+φ) where φ=tan^{-1}(-10)=-84.2°.",
